<div class="w-full max-w-2xl rounded-lg border border-white/10 bg-gray-900/60 p-6 md:p-8" data-test-competition-lobby ...attributes>
  <div class="flex items-center mb-2">
    {{svg-jar "microphone" class="w-5 h-5 text-teal-400 mr-2"}}
    <span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-teal-400">Competition quiz · up to 10 minutes</span>
  </div>

  <h1 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-50 mb-3">Tell us how you built it</h1>

  <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-6">
    To make your entry in
    <strong class="text-gray-100">{{@competition.name}}</strong>
    count, talk an AI interviewer through how you built a couple of the
    <strong class="text-gray-100">{{@repository.course.name}}</strong>
    stages you completed. You answer out loud, and your code stays on screen so you can point at it.
  </p>

  <ul class="space-y-3 mb-6 text-sm text-gray-300">
    <li class="flex items-start">
      {{svg-jar "code" class="w-5 h-5 text-gray-500 mr-3 shrink-0"}}
      <span>Two questions about stages you completed during the competition: how you approached them and what was tricky.</span>
    </li>
    <li class="flex items-start">
      {{svg-jar "chat-alt-2" class="w-5 h-5 text-gray-500 mr-3 shrink-0"}}
      <span>Then a couple of quick questions about your experience. There are no trick questions, and "I'm not sure" is a fine answer.</span>
    </li>
    <li class="flex items-start">
      {{svg-jar "check-circle" class="w-5 h-5 text-gray-500 mr-3 shrink-0"}}
      <span>The organisers review every quiz after the competition ends. You won't see a score here.</span>
    </li>
  </ul>

  <div class="mb-6">
    <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 mb-2">
      <div class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-gray-500">Stages you completed during the competition</div>

      {{#if this.stagesCompleted.length}}
        <div class="shrink-0 text-xs text-gray-500 tabular-nums" data-test-stages-completed-total>
          {{this.stagesCompleted.length}}
          {{pluralize "stage" count=this.stagesCompleted.length}}
        </div>
      {{/if}}
    </div>

    {{#if this.stagesCompleted.length}}
      <CourseInterviewPage::CompletedStageGroups @course={{@repository.course}} @stages={{this.stagesCompleted}} />
    {{else}}
      <div class="rounded-sm border border-white/10 bg-gray-800/60 p-3 text-sm text-gray-300" data-test-no-stages-notice>
        Complete at least one stage of
        {{@repository.course.name}}
        during
        {{@competition.name}}, then come back for the quiz.
      </div>
    {{/if}}
  </div>

  <div class="flex items-start rounded-sm border border-yellow-500/30 bg-yellow-950/40 p-3 mb-6 text-sm text-yellow-200" data-test-one-attempt-notice>
    {{svg-jar "information-circle" class="w-5 h-5 mr-2 shrink-0"}}
    <span>You can take the quiz only once, so take it when you've finished the stages you're aiming for. If the call doesn't connect, you can try
      again.</span>
  </div>

  {{#if this.microphoneIsBlocked}}
    <div class="flex items-start rounded-sm border border-red-500/30 bg-red-950/50 p-3 mb-6 text-sm text-red-300" data-test-microphone-blocked-notice>
      {{svg-jar "exclamation" class="w-5 h-5 mr-2 shrink-0"}}
      <span>Microphone access is blocked. Allow it in your browser's site settings, then click "Start quiz" again.</span>
    </div>
  {{/if}}

  <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4">
    <label class="flex items-center text-sm text-gray-300 cursor-pointer select-none">
      <input
        type="checkbox"
        checked={{@shouldShowCaptions}}
        class="mr-2 rounded-sm border-gray-600 bg-gray-800 text-teal-500 focus:ring-teal-500"
        data-test-captions-checkbox
        {{on "change" @onCaptionsToggle}}
      />
      Show live captions
    </label>

    <PrimaryButtonWithSpinner
      @isDisabled={{this.shouldDisableStartButton}}
      @shouldShowSpinner={{@isStarting}}
      disabled={{this.shouldDisableStartButton}}
      data-test-start-quiz-button
      {{on "click" @onStartButtonClick}}
    >
      {{if @isResuming "Resume quiz" "Start quiz"}}
    </PrimaryButtonWithSpinner>
  </div>

  <p class="mt-6 text-xs text-gray-500">
    The conversation is recorded and transcribed so the organisers can review it.
  </p>
</div>